    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imaginary Friend Institution is a singleplayer psychological horror game where you play as Annabelle Walker, an 18-year-old institutionalised patient of the 1950s. Explore the massive Grimwell State Institution and try to survive. A curse plagued this institution centuries ago, and now it\u2019s reawakening. Survive the horrors and mistreatment of the institution and escape the curse. You're not alone, your imaginary friends are here to help - or are they? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083990/extras/2138e7a1c23329075f4fc6974f343c7f.poster.avif?t=1745267925\" width=620 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083990/extras/2138e7a1c23329075f4fc6974f343c7f.webm?t=1745267925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083990/extras/2138e7a1c23329075f4fc6974f343c7f.mp4?t=1745267925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
